WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
<v Wendell Sandoval>Thank you for calling Compass, this call may be recorded.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.067
<v Freya Quigley>Hi, yeah, I need to reset my Compass card PIN.

00:00:09.267 --> 00:00:12.733
<v Wendell Sandoval>I can help. Can I get your full name?

00:00:12.933 --> 00:00:14.867
<v Freya Quigley>Freya Quigley.

00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:19.667
<v Wendell Sandoval>And uh, for verification, your social security number?

00:00:19.867 --> 00:00:23.800
<v Freya Quigley>It's nine six six one oh four oh four three.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.933
<v Wendell Sandoval>Sorry, could you repeat that?

00:00:27.133 --> 00:00:28.933
<v Freya Quigley>966-10-4043.

00:00:29.133 --> 00:00:32.400
<v Wendell Sandoval>Thank you. And your date of birth?

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:34.267
<v Freya Quigley>8/10/2024.

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:38.800
<v Wendell Sandoval>Okay. The new card goes to the address in Lowmoor?

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:47.333
<v Freya Quigley>Yes. Oh and my number changed, it's five four eight... no wait, five four six five five five oh one zero five.

00:00:47.533 --> 00:00:50.000
<v Wendell Sandoval>Got it. Anything else?

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:57.067
<v Freya Quigley>No, wait, yes, I walked past a compass on the way here and remembered the branch closed.

00:00:57.267 --> 00:01:01.867
<v Wendell Sandoval>Right, that branch closed last month. Have a nice day.
